@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title DELETE /api/workspace/v1/messenger/files/{file_uuid}
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "控制器 RestAlchemy" as API
database "配置文件存储器" as STORE
database "文件元数据 + ACL 在 PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "交易 outbox" as OUT
queue "delivery_snapshot_event\nexact file scope" as TASK
participant "沃克人游泳池" as WORKER
database "公众活动存储器" as EVENT
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as DISP
participant "签名客户端" as WS
Client -> API: DELETE 文件
API -> DB: BEGIN; 封锁 + 删除所有者元数据
API -> OUT: 添加 file.deleted
API -> DB: COMMIT
API --> Client: 204 没有答案
API -> STORE: 删除没有链接 + 相关元数据的字节
OUT -> TASK: immutable delivery_snapshot_event(outbox_event_uuid)
TASK -> WORKER: 拿起工作
WORKER -> EVENT: 插入已完成的 file.deleted
DISP -> EVENT: 阅读/重复/播放
DISP -> WS: file.deleted
@enduml
